# Project Overview
This is a BPMN (Business Process Model and Notation) engine built as a monorepo with two main packages:
- `web/`: A modern SPA frontend using React, Vite, TypeScript, bpmn-js for business process modeling and execution, and shadcn/ui for UI components (added via CLI as needed).
- `api/`: A Node.js API backend built with TypeScript and NestJS, designed for modular, maintainable business process APIs.
